<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, Nov 22 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	 10/31/96   09/30/96---Rev from    10/31/95</p>
<p> Gallons	75,137     97,572    101,043	83,902</p>
<p> Lbs	   743,551    965,573    999,921     830,295</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
